# Every text file is stored with LF line endings, whoever commits it: Windows
# editors and tools write CRLF, and a file switching between the two shows up
# as a whole-file rewrite (the PR #22 conflicts). Git converts on commit, so a
# CRLF file on someone's disk still commits as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted: binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.npz binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
